             periodic densities},
  journal = {IMA Journal of Applied Mathematics},
  volume  = {80},
  number  = {1},
  pages   = {135--157},
  year    = {2015},
  doi     = {10.1093/imamat/hxt032},
  note    = {The solver. Theorem 2.1 (after Cordero-Erausquin): on the torus the optimal map
